{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Common.HookSumIdentity","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Common.HookSumIdentity","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":19,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HookSumIdentity.hookSumId_families","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HookSumIdentity.hookSumId_families","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Common/HookSumIdentity.lean#L84-L90","doc":"Uniform restatement: every listed shape satisfies the hook-sum identity, so the\n`Σ hookSz = b(λ)+b(λ')+n` hypothesis of `balanced_quantum_twist` is **discharged**\n(no longer an assumption) for the hook and staircase families up to the sizes above.\n","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HookSumIdentity.hookSumId_rect_2_2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HookSumIdentity.hookSumId_rect_2_2","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Common/HookSumIdentity.lean#L82-L82","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HookSumIdentity.hookSumId_staircase_5","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HookSumIdentity.hookSumId_staircase_5","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Common/HookSumIdentity.lean#L78-L78","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HookSumIdentity.hookSumId_staircase_4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HookSumIdentity.hookSumId_staircase_4","kind":"theorem","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Common/HookSumIdentity.lean#L77-L77","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HookSumIdentity.hookSumId_staircase_3","@type":"Le